WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Japan is an East Asian island nation renowned for its distinctive balance of tradition and modernity.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Mount Fuji stands at 3,776 meters on Honshu island, revered as a sacred UNESCO cultural landmark.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Kyoto preserves over a millennium of imperial heritage, wooden shrines, and Zen stone gardens.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
The traditional Kimono garment is tailored with Nishijin silk weaving and tied with an obi sash.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Japanese gastronomy highlights Washoku traditions, including fresh Nigirizushi and dashi broth.

